# zoom-keys (M8): the zoom control from the keyboard (ZoomControl.tsx ZOOM_KEYS). Thirteen plain
# Tabs reach its capsule (1360, 791, 36 x 71), a spin button: its line --primary inside the ring;
# ↑ zooms in a stop (62.5), ↓ ↓ out two (40). Judged against Chromium (WebKit's eighth Tab).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
wait 16
shot focused
key ArrowUp
wait 500
shot in
key ArrowDown
key ArrowDown
wait 500
shot out
